WEBVTT

00:00:29.942 --> 00:00:33.112
we wanted to become
a carbon-neutral company

00:00:33.112 --> 00:00:36.365
and be accountable
for all of our historical emissions.

00:00:36.991 --> 00:00:41.079
Instead of buying typical,
traditional carbon offsets

00:00:41.079 --> 00:00:42.872
that simply pay someone else

00:00:42.872 --> 00:00:45.917
to not pollute as much as we already had,

00:00:45.958 --> 00:00:48.795
we actually wanted to delete
our emissions.

00:00:49.462 --> 00:00:53.633
It quickly became obvious
that carbon removal,

00:00:53.674 --> 00:00:57.053
those solutions that pull carbon
dioxide out of the atmosphere

00:00:57.095 --> 00:00:58.513
and store it safely,

00:00:58.554 --> 00:01:02.016
were very expensive and in short supply.